+# ADR-0025: Token accounting
+
+- **Status:** Accepted
+
+## Decision
+
+The router counts the token usage its upstreams report and exposes it three ways:
+`llmrouter_tokens_total{backend,model,type}` on `/metrics`, a JSON summary at
+`GET /v1/usage`, and local estimates at `POST /v1/messages/count_tokens` and
+`POST /v1/tokens/count` (one token per four bytes of text, rounded up).
+The counters live with the other metrics behind the single owner goroutine (ADR-0011, ADR-0015).
